Notebook[
 {
  Cell[
   CellGroupData[
    {
     Cell[
      "Kalman Filter: Tracking a Car Around a Race Track",
      "Title"
     ],
     Cell[
      TextData[
       {
        "A Kalman filter is a ",
        StyleBox["state estimation", FontWeight -> Bold],
        " algorithm. It is very well suited to tracking a moving car, and tracking a car around a race track is a good way to understand what a Kalman filter does and why it is useful."
       }
      ],
      "Text"
     ],
     Cell[
      "The basic idea is that we have two sources of information-",
      "Text"
     ],
     Cell[
      TextData[
       {
        "1. A ",
        StyleBox["motion model", FontWeight -> Bold],
        " \[LongDash] the car cannot jump arbitrarily from one position to another. Its current position and velocity give a good indication of where it will be a short time later."
       }
      ],
      "Text"
     ],
     Cell[
      TextData[
       {
        "2. ",
        StyleBox["Measurements", FontWeight -> Bold],
        " \[LongDash] noisy observations of the car's position, perhaps from GPS or a camera."
       }
      ],
      "Text"
     ],
     Cell[
      "The Kalman filter combines these two sources to estimate the car's actual position and velocity. Crucially, it does not simply average the measurements: it adjusts how much it trusts the measurements relative to its prediction, based on their estimated uncertainty. ",
      "Text"
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["1. Set up the problem", "Section"],
        Cell[
         "Start with a simplified example: the car is travelling along a straight section of track, and we observe its position every 0.1 seconds. ",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         BoxData[
          PaneBox[
           PaneBox[
            StyleBox[
             TagBox[
              TagBox[
               GridBox[
                {
                 {
                  TagBox["\"Time (s)\"", HoldForm],
                  TagBox["\"Actual position (m)\"", HoldForm],
                  TagBox["\"Measured position (m)\"", HoldForm]
                 },
                 {"\"0.0\"", "\"0\"", "\"1.2\""},
                 {"\"0.1\"", "\"2\"", "\"1.4\""},
                 {"\"0.2\"", "\"4\"", "\"5.1\""},
                 {"\"0.3\"", "\"6\"", "\"5.0\""},
                 {"\"0.4\"", "\"8\"", "\"9.3\""},
                 {"\"0.5\"", "\"10\"", "\"9.1\""}
                },
                GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, Left, {Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
                GridBoxDividers -> {
                 "Columns" -> {{False}},
                 "Rows" -> {False, True, {False}, False}
                },
                GridBoxSpacings -> {
                 "Columns" -> {Offset[0.28], {Offset[2.1]}, Offset[0.28]},
                 "Rows" -> {Offset[0.2], {Offset[0.4]}, Offset[0.2]}
                }
               ],
               {None, OutputFormsDump`HeadedColumns}
              ],
              Function[
               BoxForm`e$,
               TableForm[
                BoxForm`e$,
                TableHeadings -> {
                 None,
                 {
                  "Time (s)",
                  "Actual position (m)",
                  "Measured position (m)"
                 }
                }
               ]
              ]
             ],
             "Text",
             StripOnInput -> False,
             ShowStringCharacters -> False
            ],
            ImageMargins -> {{0, 0}, {5, 5}}
           ],
           ImageMargins -> {{0, 0}, {5, 5}}
          ]
         ],
         "TextTableForm",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "The measured positions are noisy: sometimes they underestimate the position, sometimes they overestimate it. We want to estimate the actual position, but also the velocity and acceleration of the car. ",
         "Text"
        ]
       },
       Open
      ]
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["2. Define the state vector", "Section"],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "The first step is to decide what information we want to estimate. We define a state vector: ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["x", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "(",
                      Cell[
                       BoxData[
                        FormBox[
                         GridBox[
                          {
                           {
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[
                                 SubscriptBox[StyleBox["p", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]]
                                ],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ]
                           },
                           {
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[
                                 SubscriptBox[StyleBox["v", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]]
                                ],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ]
                           },
                           {
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[
                                 SubscriptBox[StyleBox["a", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]]
                                ],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ]
                           }
                          }
                         ],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ]
                       ]
                      ],
                      ")"
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{x}_t = \\begin{pmatrix} p_t \\\\ v_t \\\\ a_t \\end{pmatrix}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "where ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  SubscriptBox[StyleBox["p", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "p_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is the position, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  SubscriptBox[StyleBox["v", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "v_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is the velocity and ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  SubscriptBox[StyleBox["a", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "a_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is the acceleration."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "Notice that acceleration is included even though we never measure it directly. This is one of the important features of a Kalman filter: it can estimate quantities that are not directly observed, provided they influence the quantities we do observe. ",
         "Text"
        ]
       },
       Open
      ]
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["3. The motion model", "Section"],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "We need a model describing how the state changes over time. Using elementary kinematics, assuming acceleration is approximately constant over a short interval ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", StyleBox["t", "TI"]}],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\Delta t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           ": ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  Cell[
                   BoxData[
                    FormBox[
                     GridBox[
                      {
                       {
                        Cell[
                         TextData[
                          {
                           " ",
                           Cell[
                            BoxData[
                             SubscriptBox[
                              StyleBox["p", "TI"],
                              RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "1"}]
                             ]
                            ],
                            "InlineFormula"
                           ],
                           " "
                          }
                         ]
                        ],
                        Cell[
                         TextData[
                          {
                           " ",
                           Cell[
                            BoxData[
                             RowBox[
                              {
                               "\[LongEqual]",
                               SubscriptBox[StyleBox["p", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                               "+",
                               SubscriptBox[StyleBox["v", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                               "\[CapitalDelta]",
                               StyleBox["t", "TI"],
                               "+",
                               FractionBox["1", "2"],
                               SubscriptBox[StyleBox["a", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                               "\[CapitalDelta]",
                               SuperscriptBox[StyleBox["t", "TI"], "2"]
                              }
                             ]
                            ],
                            "InlineFormula"
                           ],
                           " "
                          }
                         ]
                        ]
                       },
                       {
                        Cell[
                         TextData[
                          {
                           " ",
                           Cell[
                            BoxData[
                             SubscriptBox[
                              StyleBox["v", "TI"],
                              RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "1"}]
                             ]
                            ],
                            "InlineFormula"
                           ],
                           " "
                          }
                         ]
                        ],
                        Cell[
                         TextData[
                          {
                           " ",
                           Cell[
                            BoxData[
                             RowBox[
                              {
                               "\[LongEqual]",
                               SubscriptBox[StyleBox["v", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                               "+",
                               SubscriptBox[StyleBox["a", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                               "\[CapitalDelta]",
                               StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                              }
                             ]
                            ],
                            "InlineFormula"
                           ],
                           " "
                          }
                         ]
                        ]
                       },
                       {
                        Cell[
                         TextData[
                          {
                           " ",
                           Cell[
                            BoxData[
                             SubscriptBox[
                              StyleBox["a", "TI"],
                              RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "1"}]
                             ]
                            ],
                            "InlineFormula"
                           ],
                           " "
                          }
                         ]
                        ],
                        Cell[
                         TextData[
                          {
                           " ",
                           Cell[
                            BoxData[
                             RowBox[
                              {
                               "\[LongEqual]",
                               SubscriptBox[StyleBox["a", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]]
                              }
                             ]
                            ],
                            "InlineFormula"
                           ],
                           " "
                          }
                         ]
                        ]
                       }
                      }
                     ],
                     TraditionalForm
                    ]
                   ]
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\begin{aligned}\np_{t+1} &= p_t + v_t\\Delta t + \\frac{1}{2}a_t\\Delta t^2 \\\\\nv_{t+1} &= v_t + a_t\\Delta t \\\\\na_{t+1} &= a_t\n\\end{aligned}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "These three equations can be written as one matrix multiplication, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["x", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "1"}]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    StyleBox["F", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                    " ",
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["x", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{x}_{t+1}=\\mathbf{F}\\,\\mathbf{x}_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "where ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["F", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{F}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is the ",
           StyleBox["state transition matrix", FontWeight -> Bold],
           ": ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    StyleBox["F", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "(",
                      Cell[
                       BoxData[
                        FormBox[
                         GridBox[
                          {
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ],
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[
                                 RowBox[
                                  {
                                   FractionBox["1", "2"],
                                   "\[CapitalDelta]",
                                   SuperscriptBox[StyleBox["t", "TI"], "2"]
                                  }
                                 ]
                                ],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ]
                           },
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ]
                           },
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]]
                           }
                          }
                         ],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ]
                       ]
                      ],
                      ")"
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{F} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n1 & \\Delta t & \\frac{1}{2}\\Delta t^2 \\\\\n0 & 1 & \\Delta t \\\\\n0 & 0 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "For our example with ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "\[CapitalDelta]",
                    StyleBox["t", "TI"],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    "0.1"
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\Delta t = 0.1",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           ": ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    StyleBox["F", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "(",
                      Cell[
                       BoxData[
                        FormBox[
                         GridBox[
                          {
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0.1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0.005", "InlineFormula"], " "}]]
                           },
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0.1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]]
                           },
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]]
                           }
                          }
                         ],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ]
                       ]
                      ],
                      ")"
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{F} = \\begin{pmatrix}\n1 & 0.1 & 0.005 \\\\\n0 & 1 & 0.1 \\\\\n0 & 0 & 1\n\\end{pmatrix}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "There is an important qualification: the car's acceleration is variable. Assuming constant acceleration forever would be unrealistic, so we allow the acceleration to change \[LongDash] which we do next. "
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ]
       },
       Open
      ]
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["4. Allow for variable acceleration", "Section"],
        Cell[
         "We do not actually believe acceleration remains constant. The driver might accelerate out of a corner, brake before the next corner, or maintain a steady speed.",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "We therefore introduce some uncertainty into the motion model, described by the ",
           StyleBox[
            "process noise covariance matrix",
            FontWeight -> Bold
           ],
           " ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["Q", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{Q}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "Conceptually, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["Q", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{Q}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " tells the filter how much we expect the motion model to be wrong: "
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           StyleBox["Small process noise", FontWeight -> Bold],
           ": acceleration changes slowly, so the motion model is fairly accurate."
          }
         ],
         "Item"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           StyleBox["Large process noise", FontWeight -> Bold],
           ": acceleration is allowed to change considerably between observations."
          }
         ],
         "Item"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "A useful model is to assume acceleration follows a ",
           StyleBox["random walk", FontWeight -> Bold],
           ", ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["a", "TI"],
                     RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", "1"}]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["a", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                    "+",
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["w", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "a_{t+1}=a_t+w_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "where ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  SubscriptBox[StyleBox["w", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "w_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is a random change in acceleration. This is natural for a car, because acceleration stays similar over a short interval but can change when the driver applies the throttle or brakes."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "The key point is that we are ",
           StyleBox["not", FontSlant -> Italic],
           " insisting the car follows our motion model exactly \[LongDash] we are explicitly allowing it to deviate. "
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ]
       },
       Open
      ]
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["5. Model the observations", "Section"],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "Suppose we only receive measurements of the car's position. The measurement vector is simply ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["z", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "(",
                      Cell[
                       BoxData[
                        FormBox[
                         GridBox[
                          {
                           {
                            Cell[
                             TextData[
                              {
                               " ",
                               Cell[
                                BoxData[SubscriptBox[StyleBox["p", "TI"], "measured"]],
                                "InlineFormula"
                               ],
                               " "
                              }
                             ]
                            ]
                           }
                          }
                         ],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ]
                       ]
                      ],
                      ")"
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{z}_t = \\begin{pmatrix} p_{\\text{measured}} \\end{pmatrix}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "and it is related to the state by ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["z", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    StyleBox["H", "TI"],
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["x", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                    ],
                    "+",
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["r", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                     StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{z}_t = H\\mathbf{x}_t + \\mathbf{r}_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "where ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    StyleBox["H", "TI"],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "(",
                      Cell[
                       BoxData[
                        FormBox[
                         GridBox[
                          {
                           {
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["1", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]],
                            Cell[TextData[{" ", Cell["0", "InlineFormula"], " "}]]
                           }
                          }
                         ],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ]
                       ]
                      ],
                      ")"
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "H = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "and ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  SubscriptBox[
                   StyleBox["r", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                   StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{r}_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is measurement noise."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "We also define the ",
           StyleBox[
            "measurement noise covariance matrix",
            FontWeight -> Bold
           ],
           " ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["R", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{R}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           ". In this example it is a single number \[LongDash] the variance of the position measurements. If our GPS has a standard deviation of 2 metres, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    StyleBox["R", "TI"],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    SuperscriptBox["2", "2"],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    "4"
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "R = 2^2 = 4",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "which tells the filter how much confidence to place in the measurements."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell["We now have three important components: ", "Text"],
        Cell[
         BoxData[
          PaneBox[
           PaneBox[
            StyleBox[
             TagBox[
              TagBox[
               GridBox[
                {
                 {
                  TagBox["\"Component\"", HoldForm],
                  TagBox["\"Purpose\"", HoldForm]
                 },
                 {
                  Cell[
                   BoxData[
                    FormBox[
                     TemplateBox[
                      <|
                       "boxes" ->
                        FormBox[
                         StyleBox["F", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ],
                       "errors" -> { },
                       "input" -> "\\mathbf{F}",
                       "state" -> "Boxes"
                      |>,
                      "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                     ],
                     TraditionalForm
                    ]
                   ]
                  ],
                  "\"Predicts how the car moves\""
                 },
                 {
                  Cell[
                   BoxData[
                    FormBox[
                     TemplateBox[
                      <|
                       "boxes" ->
                        FormBox[
                         StyleBox["Q", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ],
                       "errors" -> { },
                       "input" -> "\\mathbf{Q}",
                       "state" -> "Boxes"
                      |>,
                      "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                     ],
                     TraditionalForm
                    ]
                   ]
                  ],
                  "\"Describes uncertainty in the motion model\""
                 },
                 {
                  Cell[
                   BoxData[
                    FormBox[
                     TemplateBox[
                      <|
                       "boxes" ->
                        FormBox[
                         StyleBox["R", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                         TraditionalForm
                        ],
                       "errors" -> { },
                       "input" -> "\\mathbf{R}",
                       "state" -> "Boxes"
                      |>,
                      "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                     ],
                     TraditionalForm
                    ]
                   ]
                  ],
                  "\"Describes uncertainty in measurements\""
                 }
                },
                GridBoxAlignment -> {"Columns" -> {Left, {Left}}, "Rows" -> {{Baseline}}},
                GridBoxDividers -> {
                 "Columns" -> {{False}},
                 "Rows" -> {False, True, {False}, False}
                },
                GridBoxSpacings -> {
                 "Columns" -> {Offset[0.28], {Offset[2.1]}, Offset[0.28]},
                 "Rows" -> {Offset[0.2], {Offset[0.4]}, Offset[0.2]}
                }
               ],
               {None, OutputFormsDump`HeadedColumns}
              ],
              Function[
               BoxForm`e$,
               TableForm[
                BoxForm`e$,
                TableHeadings -> {None, {"Component", "Purpose"}}
               ]
              ]
             ],
             "Text",
             StripOnInput -> False,
             ShowStringCharacters -> False
            ],
            ImageMargins -> {{0, 0}, {5, 5}}
           ],
           ImageMargins -> {{0, 0}, {5, 5}}
          ]
         ],
         "TextTableForm",
         "Text"
        ]
       },
       Open
      ]
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["6. The Kalman filter algorithm", "Section"],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "The filter operates in two alternating stages.",
           StyleBox[
            "Stage 1 \[LongDash] Prediction.",
            FontWeight -> Bold
           ],
           " Use the previous estimate to predict the new state, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     OverscriptBox[StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"],
                     RowBox[
                      {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                     ]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    StyleBox["F", "TI"],
                    SubscriptBox[
                     OverscriptBox[StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"],
                     RowBox[
                      {
                       StyleBox["t", "TI"],
                       "-",
                       "1|",
                       StyleBox["t", "TI"],
                       "-",
                       "1"
                      }
                     ]
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\hat{x}_{t|t-1}=F\\hat{x}_{t-1|t-1}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "and predict how uncertain that estimate is, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                     RowBox[
                      {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                     ]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    StyleBox["F", "TI"],
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                     RowBox[
                      {
                       StyleBox["t", "TI"],
                       "-",
                       "1|",
                       StyleBox["t", "TI"],
                       "-",
                       "1"
                      }
                     ]
                    ],
                    SuperscriptBox[StyleBox["F", "TI"], StyleBox["T", "TI"]],
                    "+",
                    StyleBox["Q", "TI"]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "P_{t|t-1}=FP_{t-1|t-1}F^T+Q",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "Here ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" -> FormBox[StyleBox["P", "TI"], TraditionalForm],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "P",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is the covariance matrix of the state estimate. It describes the uncertainty in position, velocity and acceleration, including their correlations.",
           StyleBox[
            "Stage 2 \[LongDash] Measurement update.",
            FontWeight -> Bold
           ],
           " Receive a new position measurement and compare it with the prediction."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "First compute the prediction error (innovation), ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["y", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["z", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                    "-",
                    StyleBox["H", "TI"],
                    SubscriptBox[
                     OverscriptBox[StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"],
                     RowBox[
                      {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                     ]
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "y_t=z_t-H\\hat{x}_{t|t-1}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "then the Kalman gain, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["K", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                     RowBox[
                      {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                     ]
                    ],
                    SuperscriptBox[StyleBox["H", "TI"], StyleBox["T", "TI"]],
                    SuperscriptBox[
                     RowBox[
                      {
                       "(",
                       RowBox[
                        {
                         StyleBox["H", "TI"],
                         SubscriptBox[
                          StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                          RowBox[
                           {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                          ]
                         ],
                         SuperscriptBox[StyleBox["H", "TI"], StyleBox["T", "TI"]],
                         "+",
                         StyleBox["R", "TI"]
                        }
                       ],
                       ")"
                      }
                     ],
                     "-1"
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "K_t=P_{t|t-1}H^T\\left(HP_{t|t-1}H^T+R\\right)^{-1}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "which determines how much we adjust the prediction in response to the new measurement. Finally update the state, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     OverscriptBox[StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"],
                     RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    SubscriptBox[
                     OverscriptBox[StyleBox["x", "TI"], "^"],
                     RowBox[
                      {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                     ]
                    ],
                    "+",
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["K", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                    SubscriptBox[StyleBox["y", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\hat{x}_{t|t}=\\hat{x}_{t|t-1}+K_t y_t",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "and its uncertainty, ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                     RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]
                    ],
                    "\[LongEqual]",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "(",
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        StyleBox["I", "TI"],
                        "-",
                        SubscriptBox[StyleBox["K", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                        StyleBox["H", "TI"]
                       }
                      ],
                      ")"
                     }
                    ],
                    SubscriptBox[
                     StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                     RowBox[
                      {StyleBox["t", "TI"], "|", StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}
                     ]
                    ]
                   }
                  ],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "P_{t|t}=\\left(I-K_tH\\right)P_{t|t-1}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "The interesting part is the Kalman gain: "
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "If measurement noise is high (large ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["R", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{R}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "), the filter relies more on its motion prediction."
          }
         ],
         "Item"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "If the motion model is uncertain (large ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["Q", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{Q}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           "), the filter relies more on the measurements."
          }
         ],
         "Item"
        ],
        Cell[
         "If the measurement is particularly reliable, it pulls the estimate towards the observed position.",
         "Item"
        ],
        Cell[
         "The filter calculates this balance automatically at every observation. ",
         "Text"
        ]
       },
       Open
      ]
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell["7. Implement the 1D filter", "Section"],
        Cell[
         "Let us turn the equations above into Wolfram Language code. ",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         BoxData[
          RowBox[
           {
            RowBox[
             {
              "(*",
              " ",
              RowBox[
               {"Time", " ", "step", " ", "between", " ", "observations"}
              ],
              " ",
              "*)"
             }
            ],
            "\[IndentingNewLine]",
            RowBox[
             {
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"dt", "=", "0.1"}], ";"}],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                "(*",
                " ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "State",
                  " ",
                  "transition",
                  " ",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "matrix",
                    ":",
                    " ",
                    RowBox[
                     {"constant", "-", RowBox[{"acceleration", " ", "model"}]}
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                " ",
                "*)"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "F",
                  "=",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "{",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        "{",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "1",
                          ",",
                          "dt",
                          ",",
                          RowBox[{RowBox[{"dt", "^", "2"}], "/", "2"}]
                         }
                        ],
                        "}"
                       }
                      ],
                      ",",
                      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", "1", ",", "dt"}], "}"}],
                      ",",
                      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0", ",", "0", ",", "1"}], "}"}]
                     }
                    ],
                    "}"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ";"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                "(*",
                " ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "Measurement",
                  " ",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "matrix",
                    ":",
                    " ",
                    RowBox[
                     {"we", " ", "observe", " ", "position", " ", "only"}
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                " ",
                "*)"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "H",
                  "=",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "{",
                    RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"1", ",", "0", ",", "0"}], "}"}],
                    "}"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ";"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                "(*",
                " ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "Measurement",
                      " ",
                      "noise",
                      " ",
                      RowBox[{"covariance", ":", " ", "sigma"}]
                     }
                    ],
                    " ",
                    "=",
                    " ",
                    RowBox[{"2", " ", "m"}]
                   }
                  ],
                  ",",
                  " ",
                  RowBox[{"variance", " ", "=", " ", "4"}]
                 }
                ],
                " ",
                "*)"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                RowBox[
                 {"R", "=", RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"{", "4", "}"}], "}"}]}
                ],
                ";"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                "(*",
                " ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "Process",
                  " ",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "noise",
                    ":",
                    " ",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      "random",
                      " ",
                      "changes",
                      " ",
                      "in",
                      " ",
                      "acceleration",
                      " ",
                      "with",
                      " ",
                      "std",
                      " ",
                      "dev",
                      " ",
                      "qa"
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                " ",
                "*)"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[{RowBox[{"qa", "=", "0.5"}], ";"}],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "G",
                  "=",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "{",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[{RowBox[{"dt", "^", "2"}], "/", "2"}],
                      ",",
                      "dt",
                      ",",
                      "1"
                     }
                    ],
                    "}"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ";"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                RowBox[
                 {
                  "Q",
                  "=",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    RowBox[{"qa", "^", "2"}],
                    " ",
                    RowBox[
                     {"Outer", "[", RowBox[{"Times", ",", "G", ",", "G"}], "]"}
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                ";"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                "(*",
                " ",
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[{"One", " ", "prediction"}],
                  " ",
                  "+",
                  " ",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "update",
                    " ",
                    "step",
                    " ",
                    "of",
                    " ",
                    "a",
                    " ",
                    "linear",
                    " ",
                    "Kalman",
                    " ",
                    "filter"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ],
                " ",
                "*)"
               }
              ],
              "\[IndentingNewLine]",
              RowBox[
               {
                RowBox[
                 {
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "kalmanStep",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"x_", ",", "P_"}], "}"}],
                      ",",
                      "z_",
                      ",",
                      "F_",
                      ",",
                      "H_",
                      ",",
                      "Q_",
                      ",",
                      "R_"
                     }
                    ],
                    "]"
                   }
                  ],
                  ":=",
                  RowBox[
                   {
                    "Module",
                    "[",
                    RowBox[
                     {
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        "{",
                        RowBox[
                         {"xPred", ",", "PPred", ",", "y", ",", "S", ",", "Kk"}
                        ],
                        "}"
                       }
                      ],
                      ",",
                      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                      "  ",
                      RowBox[{"(*", " ", "Prediction", " ", "*)"}],
                      "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                      "  ",
                      RowBox[
                       {
                        RowBox[{"xPred", "=", RowBox[{"F", " ", ".", " ", "x"}]}],
                        ";",
                        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                        "  ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "PPred",
                          "=",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            RowBox[
                             {
                              "F",
                              " ",
                              ".",
                              " ",
                              "P",
                              " ",
                              ".",
                              " ",
                              RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "F", "]"}]
                             }
                            ],
                            "+",
                            "Q"
                           }
                          ]
                         }
                        ],
                        ";",
                        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                        "  ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "(*",
                          " ",
                          RowBox[{"Measurement", " ", "update"}],
                          " ",
                          "*)"
                         }
                        ],
                        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                        "  ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "y",
                          "=",
                          RowBox[{"z", "-", RowBox[{"H", " ", ".", " ", "xPred"}]}]
                         }
                        ],
                        ";",
                        "                     ",
                        RowBox[{"(*", " ", "innovation", " ", "*)"}],
                        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                        "  ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "S",
                          "=",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            RowBox[
                             {
                              "H",
                              " ",
                              ".",
                              " ",
                              "PPred",
                              " ",
                              ".",
                              " ",
                              RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "H", "]"}]
                             }
                            ],
                            "+",
                            "R"
                           }
                          ]
                         }
                        ],
                        ";",
                        "      ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "(*",
                          " ",
                          RowBox[{"innovation", " ", "covariance"}],
                          " ",
                          "*)"
                         }
                        ],
                        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                        "  ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "Kk",
                          "=",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            "PPred",
                            " ",
                            ".",
                            " ",
                            RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "H", "]"}],
                            " ",
                            ".",
                            " ",
                            RowBox[{"Inverse", "[", "S", "]"}]
                           }
                          ]
                         }
                        ],
                        ";",
                        " ",
                        RowBox[
                         {"(*", " ", RowBox[{"Kalman", " ", "gain"}], " ", "*)"}
                        ],
                        "\[IndentingNewLine]",
                        "  ",
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "{",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            RowBox[{"xPred", "+", RowBox[{"Kk", " ", ".", " ", "y"}]}],
                            ",",
                            RowBox[
                             {
                              RowBox[
                               {
                                "(",
                                RowBox[
                                 {
                                  RowBox[
                                   {
                                    "IdentityMatrix",
                                    "[",
                                    RowBox[{"Length", "[", "x", "]"}],
                                    "]"
                                   }
                                  ],
                                  "-",
                                  RowBox[{"Kk", " ", ".", " ", "H"}]
                                 }
                                ],
                                ")"
                               }
                              ],
                              " ",
                              ".",
                              " ",
                              "PPred"
