     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell[
         "8. Inferring velocity and acceleration from position only",
         "Section"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "Imagine the car is travelling at 20 m/s and the filter has estimated its acceleration to be zero. Its model predicts that after 0.1 s it will have travelled another 2 m. If the next GPS measurement shows 2.3 m, the filter sees a discrepancy and responds by adjusting its estimates of position, velocity ",
           StyleBox["and", FontSlant -> Italic],
           " acceleration."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "Even though we only measure position, the filter can infer that the car is accelerating because the observed positions consistently deviate from the predictions.",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         TextData[
          {
           "There is a trade-off: if the process noise is too low, the filter is slow to recognise changes in acceleration; if it is too high, it reacts strongly to measurement noise. Finding a sensible ",
           Cell[
            BoxData[
             FormBox[
              TemplateBox[
               <|
                "boxes" ->
                 FormBox[
                  StyleBox["Q", FontSlant -> "Bold"],
                  TraditionalForm
                 ],
                "errors" -> { },
                "input" -> "\\mathbf{Q}",
                "state" -> "Boxes"
               |>,
               "TeXAssistantTemplate"
              ],
              TraditionalForm
             ]
            ]
           ],
           " is an important part of tuning."
          }
         ],
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "Let's demonstrate this with a longer simulation in which the car accelerates, brakes, and cruises: ",
         "CodeText"
        ],
        Cell[
         BoxData[
          {
           RowBox[{RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "42", "]"}], ";"}],
           "\[IndentingNewLine]",
           RowBox[{RowBox[{"dt", "=", "0.1"}], ";"}],
           "\[IndentingNewLine]",
           RowBox[
            {
             RowBox[{RowBox[{"n", "=", "120"}], ";"}],
             " ",
             RowBox[
              {"(*", " ", RowBox[{"12", " ", "seconds"}], " ", "*)"}
             ]
            }
           ],
           "\[IndentingNewLine]",
           RowBox[
            {
             RowBox[
              {
               RowBox[
                {
                 "time",
                 "=",
                 RowBox[
                  {
                   RowBox[
                    {
                     "Range",
                     "[",
                     RowBox[{"0", ",", RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}]}],
                     "]"
                    }
                   ],
                   "*",
                   "dt"
                  }
                 ]
                }
               ],
               ";"
              }
             ],
             "\[IndentingNewLine]",
             "\[IndentingNewLine]",
             RowBox[
              {
               "(*",
               " ",
               RowBox[
                {
                 RowBox[
                  {
                   "True",
                   " ",
                   "acceleration",
                   " ",
                   RowBox[{"profile", ":", " ", "accelerate"}]
                  }
                 ],
                 ",",
                 " ",
                 "brake",
                 ",",
                 " ",
                 "cruise"
                }
               ],
               " ",
               "*)"
              }
             ]
            }
           ],
           "\[IndentingNewLine]",
           RowBox[
            {
             RowBox[
              {
               RowBox[
                {
                 "aTrue",
                 "=",
                 RowBox[
                  {
                   "Table",
                   "[",
                   RowBox[
                    {
                     RowBox[
                      {
                       "Piecewise",
                       "[",
                       RowBox[
                        {
                         "{",
                         RowBox[
                          {
                           RowBox[
                            {
                             "{",
                             RowBox[{"2", ",", RowBox[{"0", "<=", "t", "<", "4"}]}],
                             "}"
                            }
                           ],
                           ",",
                           RowBox[
                            {
                             "{",
                             RowBox[
                              {
                               RowBox[{"-", "1.5"}],
                               ",",
                               RowBox[{"4", "<=", "t", "<", "8"}]
                              }
                             ],
                             "}"
                            }
                           ],
                           ",",
                           RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"0.5", ",", "True"}], "}"}]
                          }
                         ],
                         "}"
                        }
                       ],
                       "]"
                      }
                     ],
                     ",",
                     RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{"t", ",", "time"}], "}"}]
                    }
                   ],
                   "]"
                  }
                 ]
                }
               ],
               ";"
              }
