          {
           "A Kalman filter is not simply a smoothing algorithm \[LongDash] it is a ",
           StyleBox["state estimation", FontWeight -> Bold],
           " algorithm. It uses a model of how the system evolves over time to estimate hidden variables (such as velocity and acceleration) as well as directly observed variables (position)."
